       "  'ARMY!! I always get emotional whenever I think of you guys. I hope you’ll like the music and lyrics from this album, and hope it can be of help in your lives. Because that’s the motive of this album. Also I’d like to say I truly love you all the international ARMYs. Hope you know it. Always.',\n",
       "  'It feels like I’m alone, but at the same time, when thinking of it, there’s a lot of people I’m grateful to. I’m truly lucky. I will become a better person.',\n",
